## Purpose

This report verifies that valid substantive material from the theory-development dialogue, the earlier manuscript, the revised big-picture architecture, and both pairs of audits was retained, expanded, or explicitly reclassified. Material criticized as overclaimed was not silently deleted; it was converted into a definition, interface principle, conditional lemma, conjecture, template, placeholder, limitation, or retired formulation with a replacement.

