## Verification conclusion

The revised manuscript is longer than the preceding clean manuscript and retains all legitimate conceptual, mathematical, diagnostic, domain, methodological, and research-programme material. Content identified as internally inconsistent was not simply removed: controlled invariance was narrowed to Operator I; transformation received Operator II; causal closure became boundary-interface adequacy; flat contracts became typed relations; the fixed-point statement became a composition conjecture; broad axioms became typed principles and conditional lemmas; and the unfalsifiable universal conjecture was replaced by narrower preregistered conjectures.
